#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:7
#: 072172f6de7248ef9b1e97e170a85a1a a0782a86464846afa58c12392fa42417
#: ea517ebba4f24fdc8ad3bf39be801f98 f60580e9b5a54ee39e8384d73239e255
#: fe7739015f1e4ee781e4b3d345b7b16a
msgid "CHDK Camera Control Tutorial"
msgstr "CHDK 相机控制教程"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:10
#: 19e0c094f3d9477bbf820535a39c10b6 1b34ea4e9da4459cb510083ea1e8e5b5
#: 3d3905fdf3e34a8dbd73ea5e53ecf708 50dd5440134a4d70bc3310db17f0abdc
#: 8e84199855964411a7d23cd92189c0b5
msgid ""
"Taking Pictures Automatically during Missions with the Canon Hacker "
"Development Kit"
msgstr "使用 Canon Hacker Development Kit 在任务期间自动拍照"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:12
#: 21393e4c2bd346f7b8cb4064693a8c76 5e2fdaeda6024b448db6a4c9f132c2e1
#: 8469421f425442cc865f442786ba8a87 a114b68dda134fdcafe5d92ce46d86d1
#: eb2c9bc233a24ab8873748b6ebe2d543
msgid ""
"Looking for an easy and inexpensive way to take high quality pictures during"
" your missions? The Canon Hacker Development Kit (CHDK) allows you to turn a"
" Canon point-and-shoot camera into a dynamic payload through some simple "
"scripting. This tutorial will guide you through the process of implementing "
"this solution for automatic camera control."
msgstr ""
"寻找在任务期间拍摄高质量照片的简便低成本方法？Canon Hacker Development Kit（CHDK）允许您通过简单脚本将 Canon "
"便携相机变成智能载荷。本教程将引导您完成实现此解决方案以进行自动相机控制的过程。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:18
#: 205c97bba5274c97b2ab0213454b4461 5dab83d95d2b425e980226e48df6437d
#: 72611f44e2434975a692691de00198fb a60f66bfb3d64817896d61b8b185a64f
#: ece2896f380e4a209bf16f060e3706d7
msgid ""
"First we'll introduce CHDK: what you'll need to get started and tips for "
"installing it. The first section will cover adding scripts, running scripts,"
" and securing the camera to your fixed-wing plane. This straightforward "
"method is great for basic automatic camera control."
msgstr ""
"首先，我们将介绍 CHDK：入门所需的内容和安装提示。第一节将介绍添加脚本、运行脚本以及将相机固定到固定翼飞机上。这种简单方法非常适合基本自动相机控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:23
#: 013733923f2c4253b41f3b11d5440886 204a8fc3a21b43599cd45af2a19f8216
#: 7ad70cac2aa44ad881a1c9aa0c0354d6 7c3b89a7cc894f99a1c36eb89bc34a8b
#: 8be32b3ba4ba47a1b5624525cbbb459a
msgid ""
"Next we'll describe how to coordinate camera controls with autonomous "
"missions by integrating CHDK with ArduPilot. Although more complex, this "
"implementation provides excellent functionality for taking pictures "
"automatically at waypoints. Finally, we'll show a fun application where you "
"can map an area by creating a composite image of still photos."
msgstr ""
"接下来，我们将介绍如何通过将 CHDK 与 ArduPilot "
"集成来协调相机控制与自主任务。尽管更加复杂，但此实现为在航点自动拍照提供了出色功能。最后，我们将展示一个有趣的应用，通过创建静态照片的合成图像来绘制某个区域的地图。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:30
#: 0a73de218c2d48c89bd592fa530d2a47 0d75ad72d15744f586239cabccde6b38
#: 0f6754af61fb4cbaa13e5bc9fef6e276 851c82e6909248c5b55abca4d6e03cfa
#: 8b323962013340fea290c39f8db8dc45
msgid "Taking pictures automatically: What is CHDK?"
msgstr "自动拍照：什么是 CHDK？"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:32
#: 0039967ed337450c8d8841da3d78fd83 17c512a990414f02ba50ba669828fc56
#: 1ee1fa62c3f849c7979c83f5a2cdbd5c 4bfe8ae06627475882605640c3836b39
#: 73ba892b164c4e0b99e7100692c059e9
msgid ""
"`Canon Hacker Development Kit (CHDK) <http://chdk.wikia.com/wiki/CHDK>`__ is"
" a free, experimental development tool that allows you to temporarily hack a"
" Canon camera. With all the features of a DSLR unlocked to your control, a "
"hacked camera is a smart payload that can read scripted functions such as "
"shoot, zoom, and (importantly for later on) read the power applied to its "
"USB port."
msgstr ""
"`Canon Hacker Development Kit (CHDK) <http://chdk.wikia.com/wiki/CHDK>`__ "
"是一款免费的实验性开发工具，允许您临时破解 Canon "
"相机。解锁单反相机的所有功能后，破解的相机成为可读取脚本功能（如拍照、变焦，以及（对后续内容重要的）读取其 USB 端口所施加的电源）的智能载荷。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:39
#: 0ac05d21ac944d4b984979f9de52f4fa 1231b9f11dee40a3949202408e1e1297
#: 6d8b73ded04b4d26ba17652d7b2a7fec f2cf1cda80ec478faa530f743ac382bc
#: fb6191b030d64ad0b6edc4839233946d
msgid "To use CHDK, you will need:"
msgstr "使用 CHDK，您需要："

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:41
#: 28871ac9fb5f4ac8baacaee6dad6d1f9 53abd7002b534211bbbef3413e18ef1b
#: 92f892087e46479eb53f4aecdec60675 c842293786f4465286da5523dbaa9f30
#: f0c1362ed7614e36b5c2864c1e49207d
msgid "**A supported Canon camera**"
msgstr "**一台支持的 Canon 相机**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:43
#: 01635ff5c7a64b28bc0a765b79a72cc4 16c456ad4b4342aca6b26467cada5654
#: d023122d06aa442697037c6d97503e8a d838f9c02a2c41718678a826e6386fe4
#: e4c85c24cd9e4be79dad9cf5bdb15cb9
msgid ""
"CHDK is made possible by the ability of Canon point-and-shoot cameras to "
"read software off an SD flash memory card. A team of developers has created "
"Canon Hacker Development Kit to take advantage of this capability on *only "
"certain Canon cameras*. For this tutorial, you will need one of the Canon "
"point-and-shoot cameras listed on the `CHDK wiki "
"<http://chdk.wikia.com/wiki/Template:Supported_Cameras>`__ as officially "
"supported by CHDK."
msgstr ""
"CHDK 的实现得益于 Canon 便携相机从 SD 闪存卡读取软件的能力。一组开发人员创建了 Canon Hacker Development Kit"
" 以利用*仅某些 Canon 相机*上的此功能。对于本教程，您需要 `CHDK wiki "
"<http://chdk.wikia.com/wiki/Template:Supported_Cameras>`__ 上列为 CHDK 官方支持的 "
"Canon 便携相机之一。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:53
#: 001e6441238c4aba8ae236b58db6669f 28fef0e7f8b54b8aa58c8a0d82593fc5
#: 4ee205f46e9148f9b8ea9469047fae89 84e34ca52d1f4dddb5738e1ff576e486
#: 99e99a35a24646918baf7fb384eff68c
msgid "**An SD card**"
msgstr "**一张 SD 卡**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:55
#: 52369183d98c487e829917c3d5d6cf6e 5a1046de3d5546f1920435e0460d5f0f
#: 68595f7f08504e1bb29d8977c323c108 9db25ea7706c458eb081e85aeb38ce44
#: b9e00c0c9ed44581909077f746c97902
msgid ""
"We recommend an SD card that can be written to every two seconds and can "
"store the amount of pictures you plan to take during your mission. You'll "
"also need an SD card reader for your computer."
msgstr "建议使用每两秒可写入一次且能存储任务期间计划拍摄数量照片的 SD 卡。您还需要一个用于电脑的 SD 读卡器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:62
#: 103a86a7574c48a79dec18e40deca0ef 20951590bc2e4d7c8522d7436a07a55a
#: 75004563e729447e82d9b0ee38aac47b 891da5c7539d4265af09abb6a371e269
#: c25f4b7bf904498790bf26399f6dd763
msgid "**A CHDK USB cable**"
msgstr "**一根 CHDK USB 数据线**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:64
#: 2899bfe6a12d48c4a8854049dfca5cc8 2cdd531015ef4bc6ae3081134057919b
#: 6769b4dd65b34bc9ab35a989dfb9c55e 922341aa7137442588bc5da01f55691f
#: d5fe9c65f9094e9b809be5ab9d41abdf
msgid ""
"We use the gentWIRE USB with two channels, available `here "
"<http://www.brooxes.com/newsite/BBKK/BBKK-PARTS.html>`__ (half way down "
"page). This cable is necessary for integrating CHDK with ArduPilot and is "
"not required to use the intervalometer script function."
msgstr ""
"我们使用带两个通道的 gentWIRE USB，`可在此处购买 <http://www.brooxes.com/newsite/BBKK/BBKK-"
"PARTS.html>`__ （页面中部）。此数据线是将 CHDK 与 ArduPilot 集成所必需的，使用定时拍摄脚本功能时不需要。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:73
#: 1044ffd27802484e98b11966523aef72 66ec21209b054069809b3e4142129641
#: 939b0e4d12304033b6c2b57d072a6c73 a789397efa214ef9be7c1c855449a847
#: ece7a9808e794ac4a41d36584098509f
msgid "Hacking your camera"
msgstr "破解您的相机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:75
#: 3cbfb4ffae7d413abccb0311ab22cef3 3f5a0da9b2ce42b28a0f5eac18934ad7
#: cac0ae9ebac24e9a8a9eb22cc62605a4 ee0474e0ddd24834a2a87d9e9772bfaf
#: feb93d3b29c148b5b9074182d8853970
msgid ""
"First you'll need to install CHDK onto your camera, so naturally, you'll "
"need `STICK: Simple Tool for Installing CHDK "
"<http://zenoshrdlu.com/stick/stick.html>`__ (available for Windows, Mac, and"
" Linux). (You'll also need to have `Java "
"<http://www.java.com/en/download/manual.jsp>`__ installed on your computer.)"
msgstr ""
"首先，您需要将 CHDK 安装到相机上，因此自然需要 `STICK：Simple Tool for Installing CHDK "
"<http://zenoshrdlu.com/stick/stick.html>`__ （适用于 Windows、Mac 和 "
"Linux）。（您还需要在电脑上安装 `Java <http://www.java.com/en/download/manual.jsp>`__。）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:81
#: 331e7a4d53c54d4685693c666654d48f 6856f8526b9446afb6f759d564bdbc42
#: 936bdba71caa4cbe86941157d02e7105 a63b48c8ac6644228de89e350ef659e5
#: d31148aa79254551b41a22b2acedb000
msgid ""
"Follow this link to the `STICK instructions page "
"<http://zenoshrdlu.com/stick/stick.html>`__, click on “STICK zip file” under"
" the **Downloading and Installing** section to download STICK. Once "
"installed onto your computer, STICK is easy to use: take a picture with your"
" camera, connect the SD card to your computer, and drag the picture into the"
" STICK window. This nifty tool will download the appropriate CHDK build and "
"prepare your SD card automatically. The `STICK instructions page "
"<http://zenoshrdlu.com/stick/stick.html>`__ has some helpful tips for issues"
" caused by certain operating systems."
msgstr ""
"请访问 `STICK 说明页面 <http://zenoshrdlu.com/stick/stick.html>`__，点击 **Downloading"
" and Installing** 部分下的「STICK zip file」下载 STICK。安装到电脑后，STICK 易于使用：用相机拍一张照片，将 "
"SD 卡连接到电脑，然后将照片拖入 STICK 窗口。这个便捷工具将自动下载合适的 CHDK 版本并准备好 SD 卡。`STICK 说明页面 "
"<http://zenoshrdlu.com/stick/stick.html>`__ 提供了一些针对特定操作系统问题的有用提示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:91
#: 3d0f08b070ad4d88a661edddc3001f39 77a4a3c13a8c478c811278c2e7489d59
#: 7c7940b09e2045e5b313e8fb85491db9 ecedcbae487849bfb9361d5d4d2f7607
#: f2d069e29847464690d34e73026ab6c7
msgid "Adding a script to the SD card"
msgstr "向 SD 卡添加脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:93
#: 11087db0256a47bb9f002eec754fd1d8 19bfcf328aeb44c08288f70256471d2b
#: 413dccd8526442849cc3288f502d1eae 49562029b2b243e284e2ea2331a21e1c
#: 5c4fe756ec20476c938a913a1091d860
msgid ""
"CHDK allows you to automate your camera's functionality by running scripts "
"off an SD card. CHDK scripts can be written in both \\ `UBASIC "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/UBASIC>`__\\ and \\ `Lua "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lua_(programming_language)>`__: simple, easy-"
"to-use programming languages. For this tutorial, we'll use UBASIC scripts "
"with file extension **.bas**."
msgstr ""
"CHDK 允许您通过运行 SD 卡上的脚本来自动化相机功能。CHDK 脚本可使用 \\ `UBASIC "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/UBASIC>`__\\ 和 \\ `Lua "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lua_(programming_language)>`__\\ "
"编写：简单易用的编程语言。本教程将使用扩展名为 **.bas** 的 UBASIC 脚本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:101
#: 5abeb7f819204c6697d675bb6c29449a 6cc4d7989a644458b00bcec4fb568cd2
#: ba5ccc5999054e8aa3d5a2134957f45b dc0bcaebf3a94249925ddf042d9ca684
#: e42f2cbb109641d3b2361893f0a8e34c
msgid "UBASIC script files must carry the extension **.bas** to function."
msgstr "UBASIC 脚本文件必须带有扩展名 **.bas** 才能运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:103
#: 29b49af52fb2413f90a80ab574f666ed 3a1e696c471d46a08760f1eac3bec77f
#: a628673d02fd48c98024da94a6bc0fe2 bb822cb63ac647a6bcff0363f65aa7cc
#: ebb125a1696d4f60a09af3ad3fb9cd1c
msgid ""
"One of the easiest and most useful ways to apply CHDK to your mission is to "
"take pictures automatically at intervals during flight. We'll do this by "
"adding an `intervalometer <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Intervalometer>`__ "
"script to the SD card. Our friends at `Drone Mapper "
"<https://dronemapper.com/>`__ have created a great CHDK intervalometer "
"script that can be found in Drone Mapper's \\ `CHDK documentation "
"<https://s3.amazonaws.com/DroneMapper_US/documentation/DroneMapper_CHDK.pdf>`__"
" or `viewed by clicking here "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/other_files/DM-"
"Intervalometer.txt>`__. Copy the intervalometer script into a text editor "
"and save the file as **DM_interval.bas**."
msgstr ""
"将 CHDK 应用于任务最简便且最有用的方式之一是在飞行期间按间隔自动拍照。我们将通过向 SD 卡添加 `定时拍摄 "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Intervalometer>`__ 脚本来实现。`Drone Mapper "
"<https://dronemapper.com/>`__ 的朋友创建了一个很棒的 CHDK 定时拍摄脚本，可在 Drone Mapper 的 \\ "
"`CHDK 文档 "
"<https://s3.amazonaws.com/DroneMapper_US/documentation/DroneMapper_CHDK.pdf>`__"
" 中找到，或 `点击此处查看 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/other_files/DM-"
"Intervalometer.txt>`__。将定时拍摄脚本复制到文本编辑器中，并将文件保存为 **DM_interval.bas**。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:111
#: 011c869ad35f4940848a95149887a92a 189273815b8748568f360c26b1037cb8
#: 822e673494de4d7fb84cfdd1d51aa148 8c2e5a14eb3446d5a6f5546388a340f1
#: e496caeb44454beb984367155235a704
msgid ""
"This script will measure time intervals for five minutes and trigger the "
"camera shutter every two seconds. These default parameters work well for us "
"(results in about 150 pictures), but if you would like to modify them (for "
"example, to take a pictures every five seconds), see \\ `CHDK Wiki's page "
"<http://chdk.wikia.com/wiki/CHDK_scripting>`__ regarding scripting "
"parameters for UBASIC."
msgstr ""
"此脚本将测量五分钟的时间间隔，并每两秒触发一次相机快门。这些默认参数对我们来说效果很好（大约拍 150 "
"张），但如果您想修改它们（例如，每五秒拍一张），请参阅 \\ `CHDK Wiki 页面 "
"<http://chdk.wikia.com/wiki/CHDK_scripting>`__\\ 中关于 UBASIC 脚本参数的说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:117
#: 554c60a9a9414c80838d27418cb147dd 6facf47faf244e398eebeae053f93a42
#: 8bb236530d504241aaf2999177e74dc4 928ca5e2f4174260a0983b7c393e99bd
#: a8cc26e9d851404caeed0b4bf7cbb00d
msgid ""
"To load the script onto the camera, unlock your SD card (by sliding the "
"switch on the slide of the SD card to the unlock position), connect it to "
"your computer, and open the SD card's file structure. Select the **CHDK** "
"folder followed by the **Scripts** folder. Copy the script file "
"(**DM_interval.bas**) into the **Scripts** folder."
msgstr ""
"要将脚本加载到相机，请解锁 SD 卡（将 SD 卡侧面的开关滑到解锁位置），将其连接到电脑，并打开 SD 卡的文件结构。选择 **CHDK** "
"文件夹，然后选择 **Scripts** 文件夹。将脚本文件（**DM_interval.bas**）复制到 **Scripts** 文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:124
#: 08e4a32992614cf5918a0d67e0750a8c b662cfac3fca41f298dc0c90df90e3a6
#: c749c8f6c2b94f10b1452f86f5d1b71a e2a7558ee0a443a1a634b56b44782def
#: e3cf629f98bb45039c25abb815a77909
msgid "3. Flying with your camera"
msgstr "3. 带相机飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:126
#: 0ff3842a329345e2b659e6b33a83f3c0 336849e86d074bf5a3cdabe37ede2f5e
#: 4f84eef6a7624299add0c2e62dd5a947 afb4f5e5b67940769ab1d8a7519f7aa9
#: c96ebbe7db70425eb435c22b390f6402
msgid ""
"Before you're ready for takeoff, you'll need to pack the camera into your "
"vehicle. For best results using plane, position the camera with the lens "
"pointing down in the center of the plane. You may need to modify your "
"plane's body to create a space for the camera. Be sure to set the plane's "
"center of gravity with the camera in place, and keep in mind the safety of "
"the camera in case of failure. Check out our setup for inspiration; we used "
"velcro strips to secure the camera in place."
msgstr ""
"在起飞准备好之前，您需要将相机装入飞行器。为了在使用飞机时获得最佳效果，将相机镜头朝下放置在飞机中央。您可能需要改装飞机机身为相机留出空间。请确保以装有相机的状态设定飞机的重心，并考虑故障情况下相机的安全性。参考我们的设置获取灵感；我们使用魔术贴条将相机固定到位。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:138
#: 17a7f868109148b192ae6b2e22338b2e 3ce8ccea3ac4416f87d2523e4296b9a2
#: bad0b26bf6ee411e9ca9976b787de52d bd0141190c8d43fb93ebfda6c746368e
#: fbe8e7652e81424bbe5b63d806b14a6d
msgid "Activating scripts before flight"
msgstr "飞行前激活脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:140
#: 06e0305be4784ec288ac2246785fdd3c 3203866c23734ac1a1ddfe500f3f2120
#: c270cd1a06104d1ea2253ed973a197f2 c5e6f9dd257544018741733407f223fa
#: d1a89bd5c1004d938add3b92b451aecb
msgid ""
"Prior to launching your plane, it is necessary to activate the "
"intervalometer script on the camera. Make sure the SD card is locked and "
"loaded into the camera and the camera is turned on. When you're ready to "
"launch your plane, enter ALT mode by pressing the **Print** or **Play** "
"button on the camera (for more information consult the `CHDK wiki "
"<http://chdk.wikia.com/wiki/CHDK>`__). Press the **Menu** button to access "
"the main CHDK menu. Select **Load Script from File**; select \\ "
"**DM_interval.bas**. Press the **shutter** button to run the script. (You "
"can also use the shutter button to stop the script.) Once you start the "
"script, the camera will automatically begin taking pictures after a delay of"
" five seconds, so be sure to take that into account when launching your "
"plane."
msgstr ""
"在起飞前，必须在相机上激活定时拍摄脚本。确保 SD 卡已锁定并插入相机，相机已开机。准备好起飞时，按相机上的 **Print** 或 **Play** "
"按钮进入 ALT 模式（更多信息请参阅 `CHDK wiki <http://chdk.wikia.com/wiki/CHDK>`__）。按 "
"**Menu** 按钮进入主 CHDK 菜单。选择 **Load Script from File**；选择 \\ "
"**DM_interval.bas**。按 **shutter** "
"（快门）按钮运行脚本。（也可用快门按钮停止脚本。）启动脚本后，相机将在延迟五秒后自动开始拍照，因此在起飞时请将此延迟考虑在内。"

