#: 58e2af19768144529ab28dbda4e9f3bf ca22f0bc6b9e48ec917e40fc2361c276
#: f6e51ad7818e49c2a1125aec4ed53372
msgid "Integrating CHDK with ArduPilot"
msgstr "将 CHDK 与 ArduPilot 集成"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:158
#: 5220b0eacc55494096aef81dc7400ffb 9a6ed5aecd334c32b6a36fc70a62ff53
#: a3254f11e521417d8d20ee128ae2c06a aa894651e9024d4ca4ce8da532f6936d
#: b80e81fb369d45fd85b0f507bef2d62d
msgid ""
"To integrate your CHDK setup with ArduPilot, you will need a CHDK cable "
"(pictured across) that connects the autopilot's output signal pins with the "
"camera's USB port. We used \\ `Gentles' gentWIRE-USB2 cable "
"<http://gentles.ltd.uk/gentwire/usb.htm>`__. (Stay tuned for a 3DR CHDK "
"cable.)"
msgstr ""
"要将您的 CHDK 设置与 ArduPilot 集成，您需要一根 CHDK 数据线（如对图所示），将飞控输出信号引脚与相机 USB 端口连接。我们使用了"
" \\ `Gentles 的 gentWIRE-USB2 数据线 "
"<http://gentles.ltd.uk/gentwire/usb.htm>`__。（敬请期待 3DR CHDK 数据线。）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:163
#: 31a70d27a14a40e08b0c4361669ad76b 47e81fb5305b4723be7e5737f35c69f2
#: 76900b3cd821489fb54ff51b5ada5fd0 8e51b17ebee248c58e6aeb1dd82ebb42
#: dee1f05f84e14e2c86dc1416ba25f565
msgid ""
"CHDK cables work by translating pulse width modulation (PWM) output by the "
"autopilot into USB power pulses that can be read by the camera. It does this"
" by establishing a range of how long power is applied to the USB port (ex: "
"40-80 ms) and assigning that range to a PWM value corresponding to a channel"
" switch position (ex: channel 1 middle). The table below shows the "
"corresponding values between the switch position on the RC transmitter, the "
"autopilot's PWM output, and the camera's USB power."
msgstr ""
"CHDK 数据线的工作原理是将飞控输出的脉冲宽度调制（PWM）转换为相机可读取的 USB 电源脉冲。它通过建立电源施加到 USB "
"端口的时长范围（例如：40-80ms）并将该范围分配给对应通道开关位置的 PWM 值（例如：通道 1 中位）来实现。下表显示了遥控器开关位置、飞控 "
"PWM 输出和相机 USB 电源之间的对应值。"

