#: 4b94a6f0b0c947ada5c1256fae8701c0 61c745a1529b4d299394e67d15e05ca2
#: bbfe4e1abe4848b996cdbdeda90d4bd6 c7636719f4114f9fb92b514e80578a58
#: fbc123e8338742fca16ac3cc2bcd7f9d
msgid ""
"Each switch position can be assigned to a script function. This means that "
"you can script up to six different camera controls such as triggering the "
"shutter and setting different levels of zoom. For this tutorial, we'll show "
"you how to set up three functions using only the first channel, but this "
"process can be followed to utilize the full six options if you choose to."
msgstr ""
"每个开关位置可分配给一个脚本功能。这意味着您可以为多达六种不同的相机控制（如触发快门和设置不同变焦级别）编写脚本。本教程将展示如何仅使用第一个通道设置三个功能，但如果您选择，可以按照此过程使用全部六个选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:195
#: 3e90196c0284451f82673c912e6b2b9e 54fed9ca6486466c9c297dcef669fbfe
#: 847d64fc2e034c06b177e9660fdcbb02 9d5a89e7df8e41fdb42e97a35e67ad43
#: a1e6ddacf27b4a61ba927c4cebb72597
msgid "Configuring the CHDK cable for use with ArduPilot"
msgstr "配置 CHDK 数据线以与 ArduPilot 配合使用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:197
#: 015e6e99c6034a029c0a66f14533da87 6b971665435740f8ad0ce05073e52779
#: 7e71510725af4b4d8058adb1c64fd027 9b6d0532e78348cfa9d576617a6bf016
#: d07ed09850af4c97be4ea10c07c92501
msgid ""
"First we need to select an RC channel to assign to CHDK's channel 1. Connect"
" your plane's autopilot to Mission Planner. Go to **Configuration \\| Radio "
"Calibration** to locate an available channel and its corresponding three-"
"position switch on your RC transmitter. For this tutorial, we'll use channel"
" 7. (If you decide to use a different channel, substitute your channel "
"wherever we input channel 7.) Don't disconnect your autopilot yet."
msgstr ""
"首先，我们需要选择一个 RC 通道分配给 CHDK 的通道 1。将飞机飞控连接到 Mission Planner。转到 **Configuration "
"\\| Radio Calibration** 以找到可用通道及遥控器上对应的三档拨杆。本教程将使用通道 "
"7。（如果您决定使用不同的通道，请在我们输入通道 7 的地方替换您的通道。）暂不要断开飞控连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:205
#: b5caced8dec046c68671df9a5900c0f6 c0c5a054138e4618a238d03e12ff13af
#: c26941683b9742b087328307c0a75677 fb464e5a69cc4876a24516ca1198eb63
#: fba9fbbcd165442c85106f09b51aba08
msgid ""
"Before we fly, we'll need to test the integration between this channel and "
"the CHDK cable by manually changing the switch position and observing the "
"result. In order to allow manual control of this channel, we need to change "
"an important parameter in Mission Planner. Under **Configuration \\| "
"Standard Parameters**, scroll about 4/5 of the way down to find the **Servo "
"out function** parameters for each channel. Find the parameter that "
"corresponds to your camera control channel. For us, it's **Servo out "
"function (SERVO7_FUNCTION or RC7_FUNCTION)**."
msgstr ""
"飞行前，我们需要通过手动更改开关位置并观察结果来测试此通道与 CHDK 数据线的集成。为了允许手动控制此通道，我们需要在 Mission Planner"
" 中更改一个重要参数。在 **Configuration \\| Standard Parameters** 下，向下滚动约 4/5 处找到每个通道的 "
"**Servo out function** 参数。找到与相机控制通道对应的参数。对我们来说，是 **Servo out "
"function（SERVO7_FUNCTION 或 RC7_FUNCTION）**。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:216
#: 57d91bd6c6e842de8cb9774f1017a1dc b43ec01456934e39a8b3bb254790f85c
#: d11756a2b1b041feae9d71ba7426b355 d9feb64e75764484847a2169d2b0a10d
#: f5bedf24fa574740b59299c162000d60
msgid ""
"Set this parameter to **Manual** whenever you want to control your camera "
"using your RC transmitter; set to **Disabled** when you want the autopilot "
"to control the camera automatically."
msgstr "当您想使用遥控器控制相机时，将此参数设置为 **Manual**；当您希望飞控自动控制相机时，设置为 **Disabled**。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:220
#: 3c3f21a8d88c4ca3b5e1d50681fd70e6 64d12aebca8047fdb752879f34906817
#: 81556492ef4741d4b86241ebcedb58d4 dbeeea55d44d44bbb5f526b6005e427d
#: e083a3d2c8744ccaa79fb458e3dee788
msgid ""
"Since we're using the RC transmitter to test the CHDK cable, set **Servo out"
" function** to **Manual**. Select **Write Params** before disconnecting your"
" autopilot."
msgstr ""
"由于我们使用遥控器测试 CHDK 数据线，将 **Servo out function** 设为 **Manual**。断开飞控连接前选择 "
"**Write Params**。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:224
#: 2e4f1e7ab0d64ddd9eb0edcec99cfd10 4c3fe77d2e834c91bce96b4170d3b79d
#: 8fd027cf4a204ac48418fd5f3eb6d4b7 a638c235c5414d5a85b20e26373a2cd8
#: b1548d3cf91243a98d865b2d3cc46ceb
msgid ""
"Once you've chosen your camera control channel, you'll need to connect your "
"CHDK cable to the autopilot's output pins. Connect either of the pin "
"connectors on the CHDK cable to the autopilot output pins corresponding to "
"your camera control channel (black cable on the outside). For example, we "
"connected our CHDK cable to the channel 7 output pins on the autopilot. Make"
" sure no input pins are connected to the autopilot for that channel."
msgstr ""
"选定相机控制通道后，您需要将 CHDK 数据线连接到飞控的输出引脚。将 CHDK "
"数据线上的任意引脚连接器连接到与相机控制通道对应的飞控输出引脚（黑色线缆在外侧）。例如，我们将 CHDK 数据线连接到飞控的通道 7 "
"输出引脚。确保该通道没有输入引脚连接到飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:231
#: 16b36750539445b593517384ad4a0b94 6da71fed4e54499c8a959bc407ead729
#: c0a1b55bf6a54d3f9049431c22a6befc cd1f446298b24150b7edf7c38571caa8
#: ec1588db798843999bc691bd210b5185
msgid ""
"For **Pixhawk**, connect the CHDK cable to aux out pin 5. However, this pin "
"outputs only 3.3V, and 5V are required to trigger CHDK. To convert to 5V, "
"you'll need to integrate a step-up converter (`like the one here from "
"Sparkfun <https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10968>`__) in-line with the "
"cable to trigger CHDK."
msgstr ""
"对于 **Pixhawk**，将 CHDK 线缆连接到辅助输出引脚 5。但此引脚仅输出 3.3V，而触发 CHDK 需要 5V。要转换为 "
"5V，需在线缆中串联一个升压转换器（`如 Sparkfun 提供的此款 "
"<https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10968>`__）来触发 CHDK。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:237
#: 409c82ed33914e978b8e019bca8f21f0 70040f69c5a842deab678ca9aba5a897
#: 7a35291dd32e4f67b3e3a801d1b5aab0 a52d4dc16f4d4d8bb19c8d94341582f7
#: f986b11c6eb6406fa72fb824058cf21c
msgid "Adding a script"
msgstr "添加脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:239
#: 8c9c1390302e462d955881ff4bb1ff1e 99f6e64cd7f147cd98cd71f6b1e1fae2
#: 9f25e4c8a8b944e09a35763d356a2c4b c4118538119c4426ae076eb553db5033
#: e1a4f0612ce3430495d2ac7c18ed9c18
msgid ""
"Now that you've configured your CHDK cable, we'll add a script to control "
"the camera when commanded by the autopilot. Let's break down a CHDK cable "
"UBASIC script into its main parts."
msgstr "配置好 CHDK 线缆后，我们将添加一个脚本，以便在飞控发出指令时控制相机。下面来分析 CHDK 线缆 UBASIC 脚本的主要部分。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:252
#: 108070977e3e4c3b8b4a75dd24ce39f5 18fc0cc87ef54bb4bd91ccdc247cd35f
#: 65814bef0c904447a6158589eba00351 67554f1440304c0098650a7e0f204e0b
#: c02e46fca21f40989c9b62b6bae9f7bd
msgid ""
"This section defines the parameters that will be used later by the "
"functions. **@param** names the parameter with a variable and a phrase; "
"**@default** specifies its value. These three parameters specify zoom "
"levels, so if you wanted to change a zoom level, you could easily do so by "
"entering a new value after the variable following **@default**."
msgstr ""
"此部分定义了后续函数将使用的参数。**@param** 使用变量和短语命名参数；**@default** "
"指定其默认值。这三个参数用于指定变焦级别，如需修改某个变焦级别，只需在 **@default** 后面对应变量处输入新值即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:274
#: 030df0408f23430fa9f94c1fdc60fb5f 4bce206740ec490a8c481202de5f9d63
#: 56b399c2430242ab8ec730182c556b71 b01ec4e468274e0e9e9bfe3592d9cabf
#: c5e4e5b786fa4577ba06a19231bd4caf
msgid ""
"This is the main body of the script. It tells CHDK to read the power pulse "
"from the USB port (**get_usb_power**) and, according to what range it falls "
"under, execute a specific function. The values here are listed in "
"centiseconds, which is why they differ from the table shown above (5 "
"centiseconds = 50 milliseconds)."
msgstr ""
"这是脚本的主体部分。它指示 CHDK 读取 USB "
"接口的电源脉冲（**get_usb_power**），并根据其所属范围执行相应函数。此处数值以厘秒为单位，因此与上表所示不同（5 厘秒 = 50 "
"毫秒）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:310
#: 40953ac63074456d87c2890e96eaaae4 5c5868dc94ba4fd5bf0d5d3241fcdaff
#: 758d2615bdb14ef09b6065962ab82624 9e6649aac1264e2f84c476a49d43fcd9
#: be71223c0153418b9f6ca21a626c56bb
msgid ""
"This is where the script defines what each function will do. Since we aren't"
" utilizing the channel 2 options, **ch2up**, **ch2mid**, and **ch2down** "
"functions are empty. The **ch1up** function will set the zoom to the value "
"specified by the variable **s** using the **set_zoom** command and take a "
"picture using the **shoot** command. The **ch1mid** function uses "
"**set_zoom** to set the lens to its stowed position, and the **ch1down** "
"function fully extends the lens. The **print** command will output the "
"specified text to the camera's display along with the actual output value of"
" the USB power pulse (**k**)."
msgstr ""
"此部分定义了每个函数的具体操作。由于未使用通道 2 选项，**ch2up**、**ch2mid** 和 **ch2down** "
"函数为空。**ch1up** 函数将使用 **set_zoom** 命令将变焦设为变量 **s** 指定的值，并使用 **shoot** "
"命令拍照。**ch1mid** 函数使用 **set_zoom** 将镜头收回原位，**ch1down** 函数则完全伸出镜头。**print** "
"命令将把指定文字及 USB 电源脉冲的实际输出值（**k**）显示在相机屏幕上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:320
#: 1e52427f77264ce2acc010956f4f401b 577a5463e4714d8fb621175373d79e9c
#: ce53a360cff44020b0a384ef7b2679e9 e5a2aabde90c4c3d8e1ae8a53af5d48a
#: fb194c4a867044b28a69f34fafc09136
msgid "In short, the above script will cause the following behaviors:"
msgstr "简而言之，上述脚本将产生以下行为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:322
#: 002cdae00688416ba2b453a9fe11ebb7 1a9a34e3c029483c80633c4c4b40f381
#: 26bbad4414b74105b91c6639c97f585d 61194aaddcd6488098508fd848e57fb2
#: cdb775f3ad1d4448b3e9e12eb49a8d20
msgid ""
"When channel 7 is set to the up position, CHDK will set zoom to 10 and take "
"a picture."
msgstr "当通道 7 处于高位时，CHDK 将变焦设为 10 并拍照。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:325
#: 10d764d794f8427b9d1e2d903adbfa3a 3c537d8ab5a149c298e047cb2a373389
#: a5f616ce99454239ad62a1141e55db44 af79fa60664543e68abc9287bd5a7fcb
#: ce9fbfecca8047b68034387a432d608a
msgid ""
"When channel 7 is set to the mid position, CHDK will set zoom to 30 (stowed "
"position)."
msgstr "当通道 7 处于中位时，CHDK 将变焦设为 30（收回位置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:328
#: 5888a4651a014284aef6e7a591bf1bb8 a59b54beb51d4acb83b4e0a65f6c6e8f
#: d685e29eb763411bb0d6312da327f53d dee053ddfe054ebea02272332b640f20
#: f65dcd2284bd4480a2f7da8b01c3c9c2
msgid ""
"When channel 7 is set to the down position, CHDK will set zoom to 100 "
"(extended position)."
msgstr "当通道 7 处于低位时，CHDK 将变焦设为 100（伸出位置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:331
#: 661a2728c0974091ab3e6ffc67ea443f 91a427ed1a104ca8bfa5cb6bbf225449
#: a3dad3380ac6406f890d3856ee15b1c3 ccec93450f374412840b2a5bc622f641
#: d01ac46a089c4fdb8e9786e02f4efe35
msgid ""
"`Click here to view the above script "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/other_files/3DR_Shoot.txt>`__,"
" copy into a text editor, and save as \\ **3DR_Shoot.bas**. Now that you're "
"familiar with how the script works, you can easily change the commands of "
"each function. For example, you can add a **shoot** command to **ch1down** "
"or change one of the zoom level parameters. If you're utilizing the channel "
"two functions, you can easily add commands to those functions in the same "
"format shown above."
msgstr ""
"`点击此处查看上述脚本 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/other_files/3DR_Shoot.txt>`__，复制到文本编辑器中，保存为"
" \\ **3DR_Shoot.bas**。了解脚本的工作原理后，可轻松修改每个函数的命令。例如，可以在 **ch1down** 中添加 "
"**shoot** 命令，或更改变焦级别参数。如果使用通道 2 函数，同样可以按照上述格式添加命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:339
#: 2eb7e3c90cc545d0aa40fe5979fc942d 52780b00677a41cdb24fdf7efb1cd94f
#: 614b756565a644c9801c325cfce5f4c5 916530faa3704af2ae269b5d8604285e
#: f956290d2d68417a8eec134e2bf94e68
msgid ""
"Add the script file to the SD card as described in the previous section."
msgstr "按上一节的说明将脚本文件添加到 SD 卡中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:342
#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:622
#: 0d3e4a35db8b43a89c09ea40dd5a2533 2d972a3fc18a41f49e2137893c9e90be
#: 35cd6a24024b4c468eaea4295e877240 5a93882ae56f4342ae30a4b29612c36e
#: b3bbdd9492174fe2a6f65fda07f85acd c2d11e865f8f4d649cbb365adb712cab
#: df88ad1f193c474eb7e0d22e0415251b e905a79d4df043a1af4ca136bdb57e1b
#: ec7f9578f471491bbd26801abe528c14 f8281c6a17e440b18a848aa78f7fc5a3
msgid "Testing the CHDK cable"
msgstr "测试 CHDK 线缆"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:344
#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:624
#: 356e595fe8104385a207a06cb39dcc8f 45f56e8c50b344628f91665bcb8e9ce4
#: 503a26eb297e4903ab53aa18810a50bc 6283e0f5af4a4361ab5ae0b5a101be6c
#: 90513af0e6504f8eb2ab0f6ea4ea7fb1 b653abc3571c46e79cf9a34fb1a32ff6
#: c0f216e0f9264a81bc726bfde0e9be1d d142292b10574fd896efa2c1491d6c96
#: d610bb6d0f7c4de3b8ce68ea932b7a7c d84316539e3c4a01be32844cb2af9790
msgid ""
"Testing the CHDK cable will ensure that our camera controls execute as "
"expected and is a great opportunity to test for potential noise created by "
"your equipment setup."
msgstr "测试 CHDK 线缆将确保相机控制按预期执行，也是检测设备配置可能产生的噪声干扰的好机会。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:351
#: 2d7a51b33fdf4d658a990992d94c9ac6 4c0d72d84a3c44cd8db11033b965a5a0
#: 4f43c3ef319a405d94003990fb246dc4 5a81f6376fcc4a66b3a858764241303d
#: ae6a0f9f8d6e4dd0aa908fe70444fb4f
msgid ""
"To tell CHDK to listen to the cable, we need to set the Enable Remote "
"parameter. On the camera, access the CHDK menu, select **Remote "
"Parameters,** and select **Enable Remote** as shown. This setting must be "
"enabled to allow communication with the CHDK cable."
msgstr ""
"要让 CHDK 监听线缆信号，需要设置「启用遥控」参数。在相机上进入 CHDK 菜单，选择 **Remote "
"Parameters（遥控参数）**，然后如图所示选择 **Enable Remote（启用遥控）**。必须启用此设置才能与 CHDK 线缆通信。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:356
#: 08b71cd79bef47008b8b172f55387f18 0df5195d56c44ff194e6c3240a6d33da
#: 333421034b654513a7e63524440404ef a11dff6e391d4f15a89153c78cd83b3f
#: fde4f79c06474b69b3d312280b8dd643
msgid ""
"Connect the CHDK cable to the camera's USB port, and run \\ "
"**3DR_Shoot.bas**. Test the result of each switch position. The resulting "
"behaviors should reflect those listed in the previous step. Observe the USB "
"pulse values output to the camera display, and compare them with the ranges "
"show in the code. If you encounter problems, see the **Advanced Topics**\\ "
"section below for additional testing and troubleshooting information."
msgstr ""
"将 CHDK 线缆连接到相机的 USB 接口，运行 \\ "
"**3DR_Shoot.bas**。测试每个开关位置的结果，结果应与上一步列出的行为一致。观察输出到相机显示屏的 USB "
"脉冲值，并与代码中的范围进行比较。如遇问题，请参阅下方的 **Advanced Topics（高级主题）**\\ 部分获取更多测试和故障排除信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:365
#: 79f067347df748fca73a4aa613c16bc3 815062af79844818806550bdc64e1a45
#: b394afc005054f3e80f0d8c834211e06 cabda85449df4fb88c1f18b71da20d25
#: e101463ae06244548883329199d94e25
msgid "Programming camera controls in Mission Planner"
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 中设置相机控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:367
#: 14c3b4d5904945fa836012f27b291d11 1ae7fb51347c48c8a01bd066a9a67b21
#: 281a6afff07e4f8b8e3641af6a185438 2bf8ed0afdae4e398636818141e46cec
#: de12fb96a79f40ca8fe38a1b13b2ffd2
msgid ""
"Mission Planner allows you to program servo outputs as events at waypoints. "
"By using this feature, we can add a command to output a PWM value "
"(corresponding to a switch position and function) after the plane achieves "
"each waypoint."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 允许将舵机输出设置为航点事件。利用此功能，可在飞机到达每个航点后添加输出 PWM 值的命令（对应开关位置和功能）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:372
#: 404ebaba33604fabb7ce44bdfd246c16 9c53df32d9f444fab473fdacc04c0471
#: babfa4b689fb4f3d9ab6d4453800846a d4ba99f8b3e04a15b7a45c72bf8d3b6b
#: fc3419489c9b46758117bd752021d4c7
msgid ""
"Once you have your waypoints configured in Mission Planner as shown below, "
"select your first waypoint and click “Add Below”."
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 中配置好如下所示的航点后，选择第一个航点并点击「Add Below（在下方添加）」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:378
#: 7c3708d6df8c4a6ab5fe3b8edc9e5c8b a5ac77007585428ca3b002f901c8b50d
#: a8d9a74939cb42afa5419a02d7a48f48 d453d2ef8490468d8dd17768c76d3494
#: d9d9fdd43af44db3a3809bfee640a1c6
msgid ""
"For your new command, set **Command** type to **DO_SET_SERVO**. (This tells "
"the autopilot that this command means output to a servo.) Set **Ser No**\\ "
"(servo number) to the number of your camera control channel (ex:**7**). "
"(This tells the autopilot where to output: for us, servo channel 7 is the "
"CHDK cable.) And set **PWM** to **1900**. (This value tells the autopilot "
"what to output: 1,900 microseconds of pulse width modulation corresponds to "
"the high position under which the shoot command is located). Repeat this "
"process for each waypoint at which you would like to take a picture. The "
"screen below shows a shutter command correctly applied at each of three "
"waypoints."
msgstr ""
"对于新命令，将 **Command（命令）** 类型设为 **DO_SET_SERVO** （告知飞控此命令用于输出舵机信号）。将 **Ser "
"No**\\ （舵机编号）设为相机控制通道号（例如：**7**）（告知飞控输出位置：对我们而言，舵机通道 7 即 CHDK 线缆）。将 **PWM** "
"设为 **1900** （此值告知飞控输出内容：1900 "
"微秒脉冲宽度对应高位，拍照命令位于此位置）。对每个需要拍照的航点重复此操作。下图展示了在三个航点处正确设置快门命令的示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:394
#: 197cb95ed24848419a0263feb5b1c8a3 3e3b7dbef1c245888e42e9f93410617a
#: 8d47d038a7bf4682817d7aa140bdf92e b04a3081c4014569afa6cf64b5006b44
#: b7605732a33c4d64ad2459b39a1e498d
msgid ""
"Columns in the Waypoints table accrue different meanings based on the type "
"of command currently selected. These column definitions only become visible "
"when the command is selected as different parameters apply to different "
"types of commands.*"
msgstr "航点表中的列根据当前选定的命令类型具有不同含义。这些列定义仅在选择命令后才可见，因为不同类型的命令适用不同的参数。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:399
#: 596f99f2d4bd4df7ba10e00f92b4ae80 64afa6fddbb348349d7825cda0caa6c8
#: 69f231038daa480b8c1bde0a9692aef5 72d896fb47d74eca9513841cf61422bf
#: a471a6a0bf634e768cb9b86199af90df
msgid ""
"Since we're using the autopilot to control the camera, we need to set the \\"
" **Servo out function (RC7_FUNCTION or SERVO7_FUNCTION)** parameter to "
"**Disabled** (under **Standard Parameters**). Write waypoints and parameters"
" to the autopilot."
msgstr ""
"由于使用飞控控制相机，需要将 \\ **舵机输出功能（RC7_FUNCTION 或 SERVO7_FUNCTION）** 参数设为 "
"**Disabled（禁用）** （在 **Standard Parameters（标准参数）** 下）。将航点和参数写入飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:404
#: 157af97069ec4b1fa5c1dcf1d9a7da0e 282ed4c6e2ff40208f0c1f1630087f38
#: 8ab4fea9f2d8462ab1a2c300c3b2239f a2fe0a8c5d454a3c9894e56247fe6412
#: ba60291b644a452a8866ee5495e8006f
msgid ""
"Ensure that your camera and autopilot are connected correctly. Run \\ "
"**3DR_Shoot.bas** prior to launch. Fly your mission according to standard "
"practices and safety procedures."
msgstr "确保相机和飞控连接正确。起飞前运行 \\ **3DR_Shoot.bas**。按照标准操作规范和安全程序执行飞行任务。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:409
#: 25c506b0f6174c5ca4c3a3a71edd4442 3e934620ab5947a782e75bd4701c71d1
#: 4bd01a776d314fdcbcd213337260c1b2 52efedb9c8da483e90f79629d818283e
#: fe761ab5c7834ef799401e58d755b4df
msgid "Creating a composite image"
msgstr "创建合成图像"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:411
#: 0b2ff0f6b5a248daa360396d60c91086 240c2f6a05cc4d7396af9d44c8cfdcfe
#: 5af1171003234b63b42c0d47be46396d 66da3deafc634801b08774e1107a3bbc
#: ad18c339410a4a2bac1618d04d661dcc
msgid ""
"One of our favorite applications of CHDK is creating a map of an area by "
"stitching automatically-captured pictures into a composite image. We'll use "
"the same `3DR_Shoot.bas "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/other_files/3DR_Shoot.txt>`__\\"
" script that we used in the previous section. The process is similar to "
"setting shutter triggers at waypoints, only to make sure we capture the "
"entire area we need more frequent, more regular waypoints. We’ll do this "
"automatically using Mission Planner’s **Grid V2** automatic waypoint "
"function."
msgstr ""
"CHDK 的一项常用应用是通过拼接自动拍摄的照片来生成区域地图。我们将使用上一节中用过的 `3DR_Shoot.bas "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/other_files/3DR_Shoot.txt>`__\\"
" 脚本。该流程与在航点处设置快门触发类似，只是为确保覆盖整个区域，需要更密集、更规律的航点。我们将利用 Mission Planner 的 **Grid"
" V2** 自动航点功能来实现这一点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:422
#: 59a1cd2ad212487fb1a6b92a044781e2 6054449674c4408e8fbd8a79ecf1eb69
#: 681de5a5ac63404fbdbcf6adaa22886e 71c4d89df19c41d88f1cc024110c246b
#: 8734c6100af04286b38b050a4b6a009a
msgid "Setting waypoints with GridV2"
msgstr "使用 GridV2 设置航点"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:424
#: 0059c529cb4f4b68a19435f3b8046c92 0996abf71b3b4f1090a52289dcef77c6
#: 4714bf1147be4956a788ce354584b2a2 56f487f9b9f842a2b2fe1393ce117345
#: fa125d428b814605abf6c49c29a53d78
msgid ""
"First locate the area you wish to map in Mission Planner. Right-click and "
"select \\ **Draw Polygon\\| Add Polygon Point**. Add polygon points until "
"you have created a polygon around the area you wish to map. Once you are "
"satisfied with your polygon, right-click and select **Auto WP \\| GridV2** "
"as shown below."
msgstr ""
"首先在 Mission Planner 中找到要测绘的区域。右键单击并选择 \\ **Draw Polygon（绘制多边形）\\| Add "
"Polygon Point（添加多边形顶点）**。持续添加顶点直至围住目标区域。满意后，右键单击并选择 **Auto WP（自动航点）\\| "
"GridV2**，如下所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:433
#: 0f083ba72d0a42818ca08ce7a0e4b608 4d36734b82ab4ff0ac4cf86d2f1496cc
#: f5a66b09d2f244eeb619f53bf551cfa4 f9311437f4a04ee088a5036ac7255084
#: fddc5672a9a048fe87c1b4e9057ea65d
msgid ""
"Input a relative altitude (100 feet is fine if you are unsure). Input a "
"distance between lines; the larger the number, the fewer waypoints you’ll "
"end up with. When prompted, enter a distance between each waypoint; the same"
" rationale applies here. Enter line direction; the waypoints below show a "
"line direction of 70. When prompted to add camera triggers, input “Yes”; "
"*this will create a command after each waypoint, it will not automatically "
"set up your CHDK commands*. We recommend experimenting with these settings "
"until you find the waypoint configuration that is right for your mission. "
"You should now have a grid of waypoints mapped onto your polygon as shown "
"below."
msgstr ""
"输入相对高度（如不确定，100 "
"英尺即可）。输入航线间距，数值越大，最终航点越少。出现提示时，输入每个航点之间的距离，同样的原则适用。输入航线方向；下图航点显示的航线方向为 "
"70。当提示是否添加相机触发时，输入「Yes（是）」；*此操作将在每个航点后创建一条命令，不会自动设置 CHDK "
"命令*。建议反复调整这些设置，直至找到适合任务的航点配置。如下图所示，现在应得到一个映射在多边形上的航点网格。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:447
#: 2b0d69f3518643668a731c2d2a17d6c3 5a8ae6c4f3e64e15a2069f2d033f4733
#: 88ea4540a47540f7a1d153a5f34fba31 da157a4143024bfcb6ddb7d528728ffa
#: f6b670e2624643fdb113c54aea0d073b
msgid ""
"Here is where we have to switch our automatic functionality for some manual "
"labor. GridV2 has created a command after each waypoint with command type "
"DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL. However, for our CHDK setup, we need command type "
"**DO_SET_SERVO**. For each DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL command, change command type "
"to \\ **DO_SET_SERVO**, set **Ser No** to **7** (or whichever channel you're"
" using), and set **PWM** to **1,100** (to call the 3DR_Shoot.bas function "
"that takes a picture)."
msgstr ""
"接下来需要将自动功能替换为手动操作。GridV2 在每个航点后创建了命令类型为 DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL 的命令。但在 CHDK "
"配置中，需要使用 **DO_SET_SERVO** 命令类型。对每个 DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL 命令，将命令类型改为 \\ "
"**DO_SET_SERVO**，将 **Ser No** 设为 **7** （或所用通道），将 **PWM** 设为 **1,100** （调用 "
"3DR_Shoot.bas 中的拍照函数）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:455
#: 3e016942769440a1af86f0dd258183b5 6fab40b5bbba48c593eda67a155df2f1
#: bf3a40c0199043b7a8d534234d76befc c0847357612d42ed809b4f81e8d70e73
#: d2723f9b78214b8485bc13f7cd82e775
msgid ""
"When run, this mission returns a set of images that can be stitched together"
" to create a map of the selected polygon."
msgstr "执行此任务后，将返回一组图片，可拼接成所选多边形区域的地图。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:459
#: 1045ef1092c94665923097ecebf6dd67 2b9a916e3ec84963858b3e2d86844d83
#: a7d852c5c1a842b984b0263855089759 b794f109587c48529a86edbb9d71fc85
#: c8aad96b81a5465293b8c9366a67a51f
