"CHDK settings have a tendency to be unintuitive and to reset themselves at "
"random, so be sure to understand what each setting does and check to make "
"sure they have not changed before you fly!"
msgstr "CHDK 设置可能不够直观，且可能随机重置，请务必了解每项设置的功能，并在每次飞行前确认设置未发生变化！"

