#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:555
#: 2842b94f881d42b79f422fcf8819c6d4 30338422affc43ec981ba51e2459ecbb
#: 43e8bdb7ea7b4cbab29d5518dd087bf3 76884467536a40b8b656dfbb4f40673b
#: c6da3168df4f4f36bc220ea21cb75ee3
msgid ""
"CHDK cables work by translating pulse width modulation (PWM) output by the "
"autopilot into USB power pulses that can be read by the camera. It does this"
" by establishing a range of how long power is applied to the USB port (ex: "
"40-80 ms) and assigning that range to a PWM value corresponding to a channel"
" switch position (ex: Channel middle).The table below shows the "
"corresponding output values between the switch position on the RC "
"transmitter, the autopilot's PWM output, and the camera's USB power. In "
"practice, our Spektrum DX 8 outputs the values shown in the rightmost "
"column."
msgstr ""
"CHDK 线缆的工作原理是将飞控输出的脉冲宽度调制（PWM）信号转换为相机可读取的 USB 电源脉冲。其方法是建立 USB 接口供电时长的范围（例如 "
"40-80 毫秒），并将该范围对应到通道开关位置的 PWM 值（例如通道中位）。下表显示了遥控发射机开关位置、飞控 PWM 输出值与相机 USB "
"供电时长之间的对应关系。在实际使用中，我们的 Spektrum DX 8 输出了最右列所示的数值。"

